My fork of Antikythera, an open-source tool for generating tests for Spring applications. During my internship at Cloud Solutions International, I tested the dependency solver, investigated edge cases, and contributed reliability improvements.

## What this repository covers

- Spring controller parsing with JavaParser
- Dependency, DTO, interface, and repository resolution
- Runtime evaluation and test-generation utilities
- Unit and integration test coverage

